{"id":136532079004320,"name":"[NINJA ACADEMY] SHINSEI","desc":"🍃 Shinsei Ninja Academy 🍃\n\nTrain. Improve. Prepare.\n\nShinsei Ninja Academy was created to help players learn and practice the Hand Seal system before the official release of Shinsei. Improve your speed, memorize seal combinations, and prepare yourself for the battles that await in the full game.\n\n🎁 AFK Rewards\nEvery 2 hours and 30 minutes, you'll receive a random reward:\n\nRyo (In-Game Currency)\nClan Spins\nAppearance Spins\n\nAll rewards earned in Shinsei Ninja Academy will be transferred to your account when the main game releases.\n\n💙 Support the Development 💙\nSimply playing helps support the development of Shinsei through playtime. For those who would like to support the project even further, optional donation products are also available within the experience.\n\nWhether you're here to train, AFK for rewards, or support the game, every visit helps us move one step closer to release.\n\nThank you for supporting Shinsei. We can't wait to see you when the full game release!","path":"/game/136532079004320-shinsei","slug":"136532079004320-shinsei","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/204f7dedfafc487c55079438ffeb7a8e0b54c03ff7b309c9a42f230e983e22e2.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-545bd184360c6b1927dca1e298eaee09/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":65,"visitor":307439,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-28T14:30:23.176Z","creator":{"name":"Shinsei Community","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"6a68bcffc70780022ee04b15","title":"New  auto macro fast jutsu","game":{"_id":"6a681ecd863bf22c9a58c466","gameId":136532079004320,"name":"[NINJA ACADEMY] SHINSEI","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d7f4ab54041a02eba0e562a7989950e74f83bec7eaea16c722da7487a7f590f8.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-860f37c5c0889dd778afc9509d47543b-de6686c9f032.png"},"slug":"1365